  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build a Rescue Center for GBV survivors in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We run a safe house where we house women who are survivors of GBV and their children. We take them through counselling and the healing process. During their stay, we offer them vocational skills they can use to support themselves once they leave the shelter.  Our current shelter is rented, hence expensive to maintain. The new safe house is meant to ensure funds are maximized in assisting the women. We plan to have a vocational unit that additional serves other women from vulnerable backgrounds.</narrative>
  </description>
